[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13982.309, "timestamp": "03:53:02", "text": "就像打架一样，伙计。我会尽量避开你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13984.389, "timestamp": "03:53:04", "text": "尽可能多。如果你开始"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13986.389, "timestamp": "03:53:06", "text": "来吧，我会结束这一切。那可真是件了不起的事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13988.63, "timestamp": "03:53:08", "text": "但是，那是另一回事了，伙计。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13992.95, "timestamp": "03:53:12", "text": "你很棒。我们很好。是的。嗯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13995.99, "timestamp": "03:53:15", "text": "问题是我不能玩太多。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13998.63, "timestamp": "03:53:18", "text": "由于我的日程安排和我的……，我无法参加比赛。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14001.349, "timestamp": "03:53:21", "text": "哥哥平时都用笔记本电脑玩游戏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14004.87, "timestamp": "03:53:24", "text": "大概9点以后。所以我没拿到笔记本电脑。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14007.429, "timestamp": "03:53:27", "text": "甚至。所以现在我已经准备好了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14009.03, "timestamp": "03:53:29", "text": "考试之后我有空闲时间。所以我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14011.11, "timestamp": "03:53:31", "text": "创建直播之类的东西，你知道的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14013.67, "timestamp": "03:53:33", "text": "所以这就是我开始的原因，而且我打算……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14017.03, "timestamp": "03:53:37", "text": "拍些视频之类的。嗯，就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14019.03, "timestamp": "03:53:39", "text": "等等，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14022.63, "timestamp": "03:53:42", "text": "嗨，我叫Wait。决不。你也是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14025.51, "timestamp": "03:53:45", "text": "苏里亚人。那是第三个人。决不。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14032.469, "timestamp": "03:53:52", "text": "你是第三个。 Joknix是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14034.15, "timestamp": "03:53:54", "text": "准备和另一个人一起直播。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14036.309, "timestamp": "03:53:56", "text": "他的名字叫苏里扬格。我的名字是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14038.389, "timestamp": "03:53:58", "text": "苏里扬奇。别告诉我你也是。"}]